# MindAR compiled catalogs (large binaries — served via Supabase Storage CDN,
# not bundled with the frontend deployment).  The matching ``.manifest.json``
# and ``.sources.json`` files ARE tracked because they document the catalog
# contract (catalogId, sha256, target list).  Re-compile with
# ``node frontend-web/scripts/buildMindCatalog.mjs`` and upload the ``.mind``
# binary to ``AR_models/mind-catalogs/<catalog-id>/<sha256>.mind`` on
# Supabase Storage.  See docs/plan/20260802_hardcoded_values_refactor.md for
# the rationale.
*.mind
public/assets/target/catalogs/*.mind

